{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/wraith-the-oblivion/667806-tempered-arcanos-food-for-dreams","id":667806,"title":"Tempered Arcanos: Food for Dreams","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Wraith: The Oblivion"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-09-16T21:43:22-07:00","id":667806,"title":"Tempered Arcanos: Food for Dreams","content":"Food for Dreams <br /> <br /> Pandemonium 3, Phantasm 2<br /> <br /> A handful of Sandmen and Haunters have both noticed with concern the plight of the Fae. The more benign of their kind whither, and the more vicious Fas devour the remaining islets of creativity and beauty left in the world with increasing rapaciousness. A handful of Sandmen and Haunters working together have created this Tempered Arcanois, combining Pandemonium's aura of &quot;Wyld Fire&quot; with Phantasm's &quot;Inspire.&quot; The result is this Tempered Arcanois, which emits a halo of the Wyld's creative spiritual nature through a prism of dreams and cognitive creativity.<br /> <br /> SYSTEM: First, spend 1 willpower, 2 pathos, and 1 corpus to activate this power. Then declare how many corpus points and pathos points you are willing to sacrifice to sacrifice in order to turn into a halo of Glamour around you. Then roll Charisma + Pandemonium at a difficulty of 8. The successes equal the number of glamour points a changeling can absorb from the aura that he gives off. Chimera also might be able to absorb this Glamour, but changelings usually are able to prevent this from happening. Nevertheless, some Wraiths who are aware of them feel that even these lower Fae make the WoD more glamorous and are willing to sustain them as well.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/986-mercurial","name":"Mercurial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar986_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-17T05:40:18-07:00","id":668106,"title":"","content":"I like this, but the activation costs are very high. What would be the incentive to spend more? I'm assuming that the amount of Glamour that can be absorbed is capped by the number of points of Pathos spent? I'd just make the cost one point of Corpus plus one Willpower, with each point of Pathos spent being a potential point of Glamour the changeling can reabsorb.<br /> <br /> Note that the changeling wouldn't necessarily be able to see the wraith, either, and that this is a pretty specific use of Arcanoi which may not get much use. However, it could potentially be a bartering tool with certain sluagh who might then guard a haunt or fetter.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-17T05:42:11-07:00","id":668109,"title":"","content":"Perhaps there's a tempered Arcanos that could be developed where a wraith can make a pact with a sluagh, turning a fetter or haunt into a site that provides limited Glamour (say, one per week) to said changeling in exchange for keeping the oath with the wraith?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}